      "updated_at": "2023-01-23T15:17:28Z",
      "body": "When running the docker image locally with `NC_DISABLE_TELE=true` I'm also seeing calls to a google tracking endpoint (\"gstatic.com/.../cleardot.gif\") and a google docs form (\"docs.google.com/.../forms/...\").\r\n\r\nThat seems really shady and is definitely not GDPR compliant.",
